: 5.1pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"WORD-BREAK: keep-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2015 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">공학교육페스티벌 융합아이디어 경진대회</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">일시 및 장소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">: 2015</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">11</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">18</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">~ 19</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">대구 엑스코 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">3A</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">홀 특설무대</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">전국 공과대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">3.</span>&nbsp; <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">내용 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">일상생활에서 발견할 수 있는 다양한 문제들에 대해 융합적 사고를 적용하여 공학적 해결방안을 제시하는 경진대회</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">개 세션으로 진행</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">세션 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">1 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">제한시간 내에 주어진 재료를 가지고 과제를 해결 할 수 있는 시제품 제작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">최종 발표 및 심사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">세션 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">주어진 과제의 해결책을 융합적 사고를 바탕으로 제시하는 아이디어경진대회</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.9pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">문제해결을 위한 제품 구상 아이디어 발표</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">신청 방법</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">참여팀 모집 (선착순 모집)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">거점별 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">팀 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">인 내의 인원으로 구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">외국인 학생을 팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">인 이상 필수 포함</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">개인별 신청 모집 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">다른 학교 학생들과 팀 구성 예정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">각 팀의 참여 세션은 사전 오리엔테이션에서 결정</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">신청 기한</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -0.6pt; mso-font-width: 98%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-